46	- Evaluate, comparison mode (U57):
47	  - Separated users, only when the design has an evaluator: one box command, operation `comparison-users`, runs the trusted `bash profiler/cmp_users.sh` (written inline by the pipeline). With `sudo -n`, in this order, it:
